    {
      "id": "intro_4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Why did the young girl miss the train?",
      "translation": "为什么那个女孩拒绝和作者一起去吃饭？",
      "startTime": 10.62,
      "endTime": 15.75,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Young",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "年轻的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_5",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Punctuality is a necessary habit in all public affairs in civilized society.",
      "translation": "准时是一个必要的习惯。",
      "startTime": 15.76,
      "endTime": 23.3,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Is",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "是"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "Without it, nothing could ever be brought to a conclusion; everything would be in a state of chaos.",
      "translation": "如果你不准时，你会给别人带来不便。",
      "startTime": 23.31,
      "endTime": 31.52,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "It",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "它"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "Only in a sparsely-populated rural community is it possible to disregard it.",
      "translation": "但如果你太早，情况可能会更糟。",
      "startTime": 31.53,
      "endTime": 38.43,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Is",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "是"
          },
          {
            "word": "It",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "它"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "In ordinary living, there can be some tolerance of unpunctuality.",
      "translation": "我就有过这样的经历。",
      "startTime": 38.44,
      "endTime": 44.03,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "experience",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "经历"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "The intellectual, who is working on some abstruse problem, has everything coordinated and organized for the matter in hand.",
      "translation": "我有一次邀请一位迷人的年轻女士共进午餐。",
      "startTime": 44.04,
      "endTime": 53.52,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Is",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "是"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "He is therefore forgiven if late for a dinner party.",
      "translation": "我那天上午过得很忙。",
      "startTime": 53.53,
      "endTime": 58.06,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Is",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "是"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "But people are often reproached for unpunctuality when their only fault is cutting things fine.",
      "translation": "我看错了时间。",
      "startTime": 58.07,
      "endTime": 65.62,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Is",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "是"
          },
          {
            "word": "Fine",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "健康的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "It is hard for energetic, quick-minded people to waste time,",
      "translation": "我以为已经是下午一点了，其实才十二点半。",
      "startTime": 65.63,
      "endTime": 70.46,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "It",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "它"
          },
          {
            "word": "Is",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "是"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "so they are often tempted to finish a job before setting out to keep an appointment.",
      "translation": "我急忙赶到餐馆。",
      "startTime": 70.47,
      "endTime": 76.24,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "rushed",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "冲/奔"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "If no accidents occur on the way, like punctured tyres, diversions of traffic, sudden descent of fog, they will be on time.",
      "translation": "我到达时，餐馆几乎是空的。",
      "startTime": 76.25,
      "endTime": 85.87,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "arrived",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "到达"
          },
          {
            "word": "empty",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "空的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "They are often more industrious, useful citizens than those who are never late.",
      "translation": "我独自一人坐在那里等了很久。",
      "startTime": 85.88,
      "endTime": 92.03,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "alone",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "独自"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "The over-punctual can be as much a trial to others as the unpunctual.",
      "translation": "最后，那位女士来了。",
      "startTime": 92.04,
      "endTime": 98.11,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Much",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "非常"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "The guest who arrives half an hour too soon is the greatest nuisance.",
      "translation": "她看起来很生气。",
      "startTime": 98.12,
      "endTime": 104.55,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Too",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "也"
          },
          {
            "word": "Is",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "是"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "Some friends of my family had this irritating habit.",
      "translation": "'我已经等了你半个小时了！'她说。",
      "startTime": 104.56,
      "endTime": 108.31,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
