            "meaning": "这，这个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "The only thing to do was ask them to come half an hour later than the other guests.",
      "translation": "'但我早到了！'我抗议道。",
      "startTime": 108.32,
